sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Pengguna Baru
    participant App as Mobile App
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as Database
    participant Email as Resend Email

    U->>App: Isi form registrasi nama, email, password, role, perusahaan
    App->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/register
    API->>DB: Cek email sudah terdaftar?
    DB-->>API: count = 0

    API->>DB: INSERT INTO companies
    DB-->>API: company_id
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO users
    DB-->>API: user_id

    API->>Email: Kirim email verifikasi
    Email-->>API: Accepted

    API-->>App: 201 Created
    App-->>U: Tampilkan pesan cek email untuk verifikasi

    note over U,Email: User klik link verifikasi di email, akun aktif
